--[[
    PROCYSIS HUB  ::  Blox Fruits
    BY.PROCYSIS

    Tabs:  Farm | Misc | Stats | Info
    Features:
      - Auto Farm (closest mob, hover + attack), mob name filter, weapon cycle
      - Safety Retreat (hover away when HP is low, resume when healed)
      - Fruit Collector + Fruit ESP
      - Auto Stats (CommF_ AddPoint), Team select (CommF_ SetTeam)
      - Low-Lag Mode (reversible), Anti-AFK, FPS / Ping readout
      - Draggable touch-friendly GUI, minimize to logo, RightControl to hide
      - Sea detection (First / Second / Third Sea)

    Remote names (CommF_ / AddPoint / SetTeam) can change when the game updates.
    Every remote call is wrapped in pcall, so a changed name will not crash the hub.
    Re-executing the script cleanly destroys the previous instance.
]]

